    "name": "Let's Split Up (A Visual Novel)",
    "steam_appid": 876290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876290/extras/fba44ed1d418a935d40d6a4ca37580ba.avif?t=1530397472\" /></div><br><br>You play as Iris, who is on her to way to a hot vacation with her best friend and both their boyfriends. They drive up a mountain only to have their car break down in a small strange town. The gang decide to split up and you choose which friend you want to go with and where you want to go on Luna Mountain - a place that can be either charming, fun or creepy as hell.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876290/extras/5e45b374651cd02403f6179efdffbd42.avif?t=1530397472\" /></div><br><br>* Choose which of Iris\u2019 friends you want to go with and how you\u2019ll spend your night on Luna Mountain<br>* Choose how Iris responds to questions changing the dialogue on repeat play-throughs<br>* All 24 endings are available from the beginning \u2013 it\u2019s all up to you<br>* Keep track of everything using the official guide<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876290/extras/4471075f5236c3e1dc7518bda455208f.avif?t=1530397472\" /></div><br><br>* Game comes with a free printable guide <br>* All characters are hand drawn and colored to give the game a unique storybook appearance<br>* All 13 different backgrounds are hand-drawn and water-colored<br>* In addition to the four main characters, you\u2019ll come across six more side characters<br><strong>Experience good, bad, scary and downright weird endings</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876290/extras/fba44ed1d418a935d40d6a4ca37580ba.avif?t=1530397472\" /></div><br><br>You play as Iris, who is on her to way to a hot vacation with her best friend and both their boyfriends. They drive up a mountain only to have their car break down in a small strange town. The gang decide to split up and you choose which friend you want to go with and where you want to go on Luna Mountain - a place that can be either charming, fun or creepy as hell.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876290/extras/5e45b374651cd02403f6179efdffbd42.avif?t=1530397472\" /></div><br><br>* Choose which of Iris\u2019 friends you want to go with and how you\u2019ll spend your night on Luna Mountain<br>* Choose how Iris responds to questions changing the dialogue on repeat play-throughs<br>* All 24 endings are available from the beginning \u2013 it\u2019s all up to you<br>* Keep track of everything using the official guide<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/876290/extras/4471075f5236c3e1dc7518bda455208f.avif?t=1530397472\" /></div><br><br>* Game comes with a free printable guide <br>* All characters are hand drawn and colored to give the game a unique storybook appearance<br>* All 13 different backgrounds are hand-drawn and water-colored<br>* In addition to the four main characters, you\u2019ll come across six more side characters<br><strong>Experience good, bad, scary and downright weird endings</strong>",
